+  with redirections":
+
+  ```sh
+  exec >&2 2>/dev/null
+  echo reached
+  ```
+
+  must send "reached" to stderr (fd 1 was dup'd from fd 2 *before* fd
+  2 got retargeted to /dev/null); shish sends it to the original
+  stdout instead.
 
   **Repro:**
   ```sh
-  # Run the exec conformance test
   sh tests/run-tst.sh build/x86_64-linux-gnu/shish tests/posix exec-p.tst
-  # 3 failures in redirection preservation and error reporting
+  # 1 failure: exec-p.tst:15
+  ```
